"description":"OneState – Live Free, Play Real\n\nIn OneState, real players run everything — the streets, the businesses, the law. A mobile open-world roleplay set in modern LA, up to 900 of them per server, not NPCs. Find your people in the biggest Social RP community on mobile.\n\nLive Your Role\nCreate your own story in a living city, explore our highly detailed pocket-sized copy of LA! Be whoever you want to be in that rp life simulator – gangster, police officer, serviceman, medic, CEO of your own business empire. Build your life from the ground up and make your mark in a massive role play open world that never sleeps.\n\nHustle - Trade - Profit\nStart small, dream big. Work your job, flip deals, build your business, and invest in real estate. Rise from the streets to the skyline. In OneState ambition pays off – your hustle defines you. Wanna’ matter? Make a move! Live it all in roleplay online multiplayer, where every step counts.\n\nUphold the Law or Break It\nEnforce the law as a police officer, dominate the urban battlefield as a soldier, or save lives as a medic. Not your role play style? Then live the thug life, join the gang game, conquer territories, and build your street empire. Every path matters. This is true city life role-play!\n\nDrive Hard – Drive Custom\nOwn the streets with fully-tunable rides. Collect, upgrade, and design cars that scream personality. There’s no proper city roleplay without a proper car park, right? Cruise, drift, or escape high-speed police pursuits – every car race, every new tune-up adds to your fame. Your garage in OneState not just stores your cars, it also contains part of your online rp identity.\n\nCreate Your Image\nLife roleplay is about being authentic and unique. Customize your look, and style. From your outfit and accessories to your attitude – everything tells your story. Develop your reputation, climb ranks, and live it your way in the ultimate RP mobile simulator.\n\nJoin a Living City\nSeasonal events and fresh drops keep OneState a constantly evolving online roleplay world. Interact with real people in a massive RP community on mobile.\n\nCreate your story and live it out in OneState – the life simulator where freedom is real!\n\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/onestate_game/\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/aKj4QanDvH\nSupport mail: 1state.support@chillbase.net", "languageCodesISO2A":["AR", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "KO", "PT", "RU", "ES", "TR"], "fileSizeBytes":"3954811904", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":345, "trackContentRating":"17+", "sellerUrl":"https://chillbase.net/", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.284060000000000201225702767260372638702392578125, "minimumOsVersion":"16.0", "userRatingCount":345}, 
